625 0 obj
  << /ActualText (EXPERIENCE\n\nCreative Art Trainee \055 WPP Production\054 Madrid\050September 2026 \023 Present\n\nDevelopment and adaptation of graphic assets for Movistar\054 primarily focused on in\055store communications and point\055of\055sale materials\056\n\nGraphic Design Intern \055 WSC\054 Madrid\050September \023 December 2025\n\nSupported the development of branding\054 visual identity and graphic design projects for a range of clients\056 Supported the design of digital interfaces in Figma\056\nConducted visual research\054 benchmarking and reference sourcing to support project development\056\nCollaborated with the design team throughout all stages of the creative process\054 from concept development through to final delivery\056\nAdapted designs in response to team feedback and client requirements\056\n\nEDUCATION\n\nBachelor in Multimedia and Graphic Design \055 UDIT\054 Madrid\050September 2023 \023 June 2027\n\nErasmus\053 Programme\054 Bachelor in Graphic Design \055 Metropolitan University\054 Budapest\050February \023 June 2026\n\nSOFTWARE\n\nFigma\nAdobe Illustrator\nAdobe Photoshop\nAdobe InDesign\nAdobe Premiere\nAdobe After Effects\n\nLANGUAGES\n\nSpanish \055 Native\nEnglish \055 C2\054 Cambridge English\072 Proficiency \050CPE\051\nGerman \055 A1\054 Goethe\055Institute)
